  "materializationRules": [
    "Accept AdaptiveTokenLaunched only from a launcher address pinned in the deployment manifest.",
    "Require the hook to have AdaptiveCurveFeeHookDeployed provenance from the pinned factory in the same receipt or an earlier canonical block.",
    "Require exactly curvePointCount point events with contiguous indexes, strictly increasing fdvIndex values and full-range endpoints.",
    "Require AdaptiveCurveRegistered, AdaptiveCurveConfigured and AdaptiveTokenLaunched to agree on token, poolId, hook and curveHash.",
    "Require AdaptiveCurveDisclosure to report launcherFeeBps 10, transferTaxBps 0, lpFeePips 0, symmetricBuyAndSell true and usesPreSwapTick true.",
    "Treat AdaptiveCreatorInitialBuy with both amounts zero as a valid no-buy launch.",
    "Rollback all derived rows on a chain reorganization; confirmation depth is an operator policy, not a contract guarantee."
  ]
